    "notes": "With the version unchanged (an update to its current value, the re-import case) the field delta is empty and the server's rows are the whole delta. The flag on any other address is refused `schema-violation`. The audit's `change_set_staged` record lists the server's removes and creates under `server_operations`, beside the client's update under `operations`."
